  "notes":[
    "The default benchmark order is open-source first: Qwen 4B for volume, Qwen 30B-A3B Instruct for planning/review, Qwen 30B-A3B Thinking for difficult reasoning and Kimi K2.5 only as a ceiling challenger.",
